# Android signing material. NEVER commit these — the repo is public, and
# whoever holds the keystore plus its password can ship updates Android
# accepts as genuinely yours. Losing it means you can never update the app.
*.keystore
*.jks
signing-key-info.txt
*.apk
*.aab
